            (the model's limits, the generic compare, facts only, the limits list; tests T32, T37, T38, T40 to T43 are
            this Task's).

            **Approach:** the model is the existing `dsl/lifecycle*.ts` modules (rules, step, owed), adapted, and
            imports nothing from a runtime; generated runs are a reload after every step of
            the existing cases, the old suite's search, and seeded sequences with shrinking; hand cases become the
            model's tests; round-14 becomes a mutant host with a limits list a run verifies.

            **Owns (records review, 2026-11-11):** the script Schema, the script player and the shrinker, over hand
            fixtures; @task.V3.T47 reuses them for parts and builds none of its own (@spec.Conformance.R15, R22). The
            generators run on round-14, still with no composite.

            **Narrowed (replan, accepted 2026-11-11), slice R:** first restore the disposal catch of
            `o6.settled-in-bound-stays-held`, so falsify round-14 is 147/147 and nothing else in the Epic starts red.
            Then the expect/compare split (obligation code takes no observation; lint covers `lifecycle-step.ts`,
